## Run panel loads FIRST: UncappedKeystone's BuildFrame caches its frame on the
## first embed, so if it ran before UncappedKeystoneRun existed the "Your
## Keystone" sub-tab would be missing for the rest of the session.
UncappedKeystone\UncappedKeystoneRun.lua
## [#605] The LFG noticeboard. Loads AFTER the run panel for the same reason
## the run panel loads before UncappedKeystone: whoever builds a frame first
## caches it, so load order decides which sub-tabs exist for the session.
UncappedKeystone\UncappedLFG.lua
UncappedKeystone\UncappedKeystone.lua
UncappedTransmog\UncappedTransmogData.lua
UncappedTransmog\UncappedTransmog.lua
## Loads LAST, and after UncappedLFG in particular: it retires the stock Dungeon
## Finder and points its button and keybind at /mlfg, so the handler it calls has
## to be registered before anyone can press anything. Owner ruling 2026-08-18.
UncappedNoDungeonFinder.lua
